flowchart TD
  Mutation[Parcel lifecycle mutation] --> Save[TypeORM entity save]
  Save --> Subscriber[ParcelTrackingSubscriber]
  Subscriber --> Snapshot[Current parcels row]
  Subscriber --> Ledger[(parcel_tracking_events)]

  Request[GET /parcels/tracking/:trackingNumber] --> Lookup[Lookup by tracking_number or parcel_tx_id]
  Lookup --> Enrich[ParcelTrackingService.enrichParcel]
  Ledger --> Enrich
  Enrich --> Legacy{Stored events?}
  Legacy -->|No| Fallback[Build recoverable legacy timeline]
  Legacy -->|Yes| Timeline[Load immutable public events]
  Fallback --> Mapper[toParcelDetail]
  Timeline --> Mapper
  Enrich --> Returns[Load original and all return descendants]
  Returns --> Mapper

  Mapper --> SnapshotResponse[Current parcel snapshot]
  Mapper --> Tracking[tracking]
  Tracking --> Events[events: newest first]
  Tracking --> Milestones[lifecycle and compatibility milestones]
  Tracking --> Journey[hub journey snapshot]
  Tracking --> Links[original / returns / active_return]

  style Ledger fill:#fff3bf,stroke:#7f6000
  style Tracking fill:#d3f9d8,stroke:#2b8a3e
  style Events fill:#d0ebff,stroke:#1864ab
  style Links fill:#f3d9fa,stroke:#862e9c
